{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Containerized Network AI Application.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Containerized Network AI Application.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"containerized network ai application containerized network ai application","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Containerized Network AI Application.md","fileName":"Containerized Network AI Application.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Containerized Network AI Application","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-27 18:30\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Network AI Application Architecture]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Network AI Application Architecture","ainetworkingcookbook.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Containerized Network AI Application.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Containerized Network AI Application.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"containerized network ai application containerized network ai application","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Containerized Network AI Application.md","fileName":"Containerized Network AI Application.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Containerized Network AI Application","heading":"Containerized Network AI Application","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"A containerized network AI application packages its Python runtime, dependencies, API server, and entry point into a repeatable image. Binding the service to the container interface and publishing an explicit port makes the FastAPI application reachable outside the container.\n\nThe image should not contain API keys or durable conversation databases. Secrets are injected at runtime, and state that must survive replacement belongs in a volume or external service. A small base image improves portability, but production readiness also requires pinned dependencies, a non-root user, health checks, and restricted network access.","tags":["baby"],"links":["Network AI Application Architecture","ainetworkingcookbook.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Containerized Network AI Application.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Containerized Network AI Application.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"containerized network ai application containerized network ai application","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Containerized Network AI Application.md","fileName":"Containerized Network AI Application.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Containerized Network AI Application","heading":"References","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"[[ainetworkingcookbook.pdf]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Network AI Application Architecture","ainetworkingcookbook.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""}]}